  "text": "My YouTube channel on AI automation has over a million subscribers. And the most frequent comments people make across the five hundred and twenty-six videos on the channel aren't technical questions about which tools or workflows to use. They ask about how to actually make money with their AI skills. These people get stuck in a loop where they keep using their time to learn new things and dive into the latest tools and the latest models instead of using the skills and knowledge that they already have to actually make money. Because it feels easier to learn more than it does to risk being ignored or rejected by other people. So this SOP right here cuts through all the overthinking and makes it feel just as good to sell as it does to learn. It'll show you the one-sentence pitch that works today, how to build credibility with zero case studies, the exact outreach messages that land projects. This SOP has been used by hundreds of builders to close their first client deal, and most of them did it within thirty days of getting their hands on this SOP. So click the link, enter your email, download the SOP, and get your first client",
